## Langfuse adds spending budgets to its AI gateway

Source: Langfuse — https://langfuse.com/changelog/2026-11-19-ai-gateway-budgets
Published: 2026-11-19
Channel: news

Langfuse AI Gateway is a service for routing model requests while recording usage. Langfuse says teams can now set spending budgets for individual API keys, individual users and the entire organization. They can also set defaults for keys or users that have no individual budget.

Once a budget is reached, the gateway rejects requests until that budget resets. The announcement describes the available scopes and enforcement behavior, but does not give further operational detail about reset configuration or request handling.

Why it matters: Teams using the gateway can consider the availability impact of request rejection when setting spending limits.

